                                                "sense_id": "014b2e88-c929-3e6a-8929-f804d3c41d7c",
                                                "text": "Teachers are now required to teach intercultural communicative competence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cda36b58-2d9b-37cf-8b6d-4e4ea376ca65",
                                        "entry_id": "79c9fa3d-453d-3c4d-b34a-0a013f2feb46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or state of being able or suitable for a particular task; the quality or state of being competent for a particular task or skill."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c0dad10-5f50-39bc-b039-a1a7332bce4f",
                                        "entry_id": "79c9fa3d-453d-3c4d-b34a-0a013f2feb46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The system of linguistic knowledge possessed by native speakers of a language, as opposed to its actual use in concrete situations (performance), cf. linguistic competence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de34dd37-c68d-3c50-ba24-5f0ef7a02080",
                                        "entry_id": "79c9fa3d-453d-3c4d-b34a-0a013f2feb46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sustainable income."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2ffc3c2-7734-479b-9134-32730cc3fb65",
                                                "sense_id": "de34dd37-c68d-3c50-ba24-5f0ef7a02080",
                                                "text": "Reason's whole pleasure, all the joys of sense, / Lie in three words — health, peace, and competence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f2827a3-3a53-45b4-890f-71f08e59c1d1",
                                                "sense_id": "de34dd37-c68d-3c50-ba24-5f0ef7a02080",
                                                "text": "“money can only give happiness where there is nothing else to give it. Beyond a competence, it can afford no real satisfaction, as far as mere self is concerned.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc0d4f23-4b49-4584-abe3-c285aeed8494",
                                                "sense_id": "de34dd37-c68d-3c50-ba24-5f0ef7a02080",
                                                "text": "A few years ago there lived in a city on the Mississippi a happy family, consisting of a husband, wife, and two children. They were in comfortable circumstances—he able to earn a competence—kind, affable, affectionate, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "170a08b0-cfb6-3eae-a140-16277bb62e62",
                                        "entry_id": "79c9fa3d-453d-3c4d-b34a-0a013f2feb46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "the legal authority to deal with a matter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f885901-c31d-4699-bac0-f5ca91a87bb4",
                                                "sense_id": "170a08b0-cfb6-3eae-a140-16277bb62e62",
                                                "text": "The bill was denied royal assent because the Scottish Parliament does not have legislative competence on the bill's matter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7061c169-f43a-4330-8f4a-6c808dc513a0",
                                                "sense_id": "170a08b0-cfb6-3eae-a140-16277bb62e62",
                                                "text": "K C Wheare's definition of federalism requires that two governments be independent and co-ordinate within their own spheres, generally set out by the division of competences codified in a constitution, which is supreme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6794d706-7351-4443-a0ea-dd9ba66be999",
                                                "sense_id": "170a08b0-cfb6-3eae-a140-16277bb62e62",
                                                "text": "Also, the Constitutional Court has tried to reduce impunity in cases of human rights abuses by narrowly interpreting the legal competence of military justice to investigate military and police officers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55a2bb70-a288-31f1-bda6-d77679370e0f",
                                        "entry_id": "79c9fa3d-453d-3c4d-b34a-0a013f2feb46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The degree to which a rock is resistant to deformation or flow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
